"rustyfiles on the same network find each other; files go encrypted straight from device to device, with no server or account. When you turn it on, macOS may ask to let rustyfiles find devices on your local network: allow it.": "同一网络中的 rustyfiles 会彼此发现；文件在设备之间加密直接传输，无需服务器或账户。开启后，macOS 可能会请求允许 rustyfiles 查找本地网络中的设备，请予以允许。",
"Can’t look for nearby devices": "无法查找附近的设备",
"Who can see this Mac": "谁可以看到此 Mac",
"Everyone lasts 10 minutes, then it goes back to trusted devices only. To take files from a device you haven’t paired with, or to pair with one, choose Everyone.": "“所有人”会持续 10 分钟，之后恢复为仅受信任的设备。若要接收来自未配对设备的文件，或与其配对，请选择“所有人”。",
"Look again": "重新查找",
"Forgets the devices listed, looks for them again and announces this Mac again.": "忘记已列出的设备，重新查找，并再次向其他设备宣告此 Mac。",
"rustyfiles must be open on the other device, with Ferry on. A device you haven’t paired with is listed only while its visibility is Everyone.": "另一台设备上必须打开 rustyfiles 并开启 Ferry。未配对的设备只有在其可见性为“所有人”时才会列出。",
"The speed test did not finish.": "速度测试未完成。",
"Other devices see this Mac by this name. Leave it empty to use the computer’s name.": "其他设备将以此名称看到此 Mac。留空则使用电脑名称。",
